Package: rnaseq-pipeline
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Prem Pratap Singh <ppssingh@ucdavis.edu>
Depends: bash, curl, ca-certificates, util-linux, gzip, git
Section: science
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/prem-p-singh/RNASeq-pipeline
Description: Snakemake RNA-seq pipeline with a locked Conda runtime
 Installs the workflow and the rnaseq-pipeline and rnaseq-new-project
 commands. A pinned Miniforge is installed under /opt/rnaseq-pipeline/conda.
 The 580-package analysis runtime is created per user on first run.
